flowchart LR
    IN([TicketInput]):::io --> RT[Intent Router]

    RT -->|RouterOutput| BE[Billing Expert]
    RT -->|RouterOutput| TE[Technical Expert]
    RT -->|RouterOutput| RE[Refund Expert]

    BE -->|ExpertSignal| PR[Policy RAG Agent]
    TE -->|ExpertSignal| PR
    RE -->|ExpertSignal| PR

    KB[(Policy KB\nvector store)]:::store -.retrieve.-> PR

    PR -->|PolicyHit| PS[Priority Scorer]
    PS -->|PriorityDecision| JG[Judge Agent]
    JG -->|JudgeVerdict| OUT([TriageResult]):::io

    JG -. reject / low confidence .-> HUMAN([Human review]):::review

    classDef io fill:#1d4ed8,stroke:#93c5fd,color:#fff;
    classDef store fill:#374151,stroke:#9ca3af,color:#fff;
    classDef review fill:#92400e,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#fff;
